  "about_item": [
    "IMMEDIATE ITCH RELIEF & CALMING AROMATHERAPY Specially formulated for dogs with dry, itchy, or sensitive skin. Infused with high-grade Organic Lavender Essential Oil, this soothing wash hydrates the skin to relieve scratching urges caused by dryness. The natural aromatic scent turns stressful bath times into a relaxing spa experience, significantly reducing tension for nervous pets during grooming.",
    "PERFECT COMPANION FOR OUTDOOR DOGS Enjoy peace of mind during your walks. While we do not use harsh chemicals, our potent lavender formula provides a deep clean that removes mud, grass stains, and outdoor grime effortlessly. It leaves an invisible, fragrant layer on your pet's coat, ensuring they return from their adventures in the park or woods smelling fresh and looking pristine.",
    "EXCLUSIVE \"FARM TO BOTTLE\" PURITY We are not just sellers; we are the \"Farmers.\" Sourced directly from our own 1,000,000 lavender seedlings grown in the pristine Sea-Forest-Village triangle. We cultivate with eco-friendly methods and distill the oils ourselves. No middlemen, just 100% traceable, hand-harvested purity from our soil to your home.",
    "HYPOALLERGENIC & PH BALANCED FORMULA Your dog’s skin is 3x thinner than human skin and requires special care. Dr. Lavender is pH-balanced specifically for canines to preserve natural skin oils. Free from parabens, sulfates, synthetic dyes, and harsh soaps, making it the safest choice for puppies, senior dogs, and breeds prone to seasonal skin sensitivities.",
    "DEEP MOISTURIZING & COAT RESTORATION Prevents dry flakes and dullness by deeply hydrating the skin. Our nutrient-rich formula nourishes dry, brittle fur from root to tip, leaving the coat feeling silky soft, detangled, and easy to brush. Perfect for restoring the natural shine of dull coats without leaving any greasy residue.",
    "LONG-LASTING ODOR CONTROL & FRESHNESS Unlike other shampoos that simply mask odors with artificial perfumes, our natural ingredients neutralize \"wet dog smell\" at the source. It leaves a gentle, long-lasting floral scent that keeps your furry friend smelling fresh for days, as if they just rolled in a lavender field.",
    "CRUELTY-FREE & SATISFACTION PROMISE We love animals as much as you do. Our products are never tested on animals and are packaged in eco-friendly materials. We are confident in our premium quality; if you or your pet are not completely satisfied with the soothing results."
  ],
